:: Literature Review ::

This section discusses some of algorithms our-team explored before going through the project implementation

Our-team (dec) using AI algorithm for autonomous vehicles

AI algorithm (dep-by) Our-team on FPGA

Research (conducted) Our-team for getting the most suitable AI algorithm

